{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Begin your Ta-Miu adventure!\u00a0\ud83d\udc08</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this playable demo, you\u2019ll discover the beginning of <strong>a feline heroine\u2019s story</strong>, chosen by the goddess <strong>Bastet</strong>. Learn how a stray cat found a new home in the <strong>Pharaoh\u2019s palace</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107010/extras/c92be853c73f92e79b06d85b651e50fc.poster.avif?t=1761153332\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107010/extras/c92be853c73f92e79b06d85b651e50fc.webm?t=1761153332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107010/extras/c92be853c73f92e79b06d85b651e50fc.mp4?t=1761153332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of Ta-Miu, <strong>explore the valley, investigate a mysterious pyramid</strong>, and delve into a secret tomb. Meet <strong>Sahi \u2013 a mysterious mummy</strong> who will join you on your journey. Explore varied environments from a unique feline perspective: climb, uncover hidden paths, and use your cat-like intellect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107010/extras/6bb3d69522d710862858920f3a3056b3.poster.avif?t=1761153332\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107010/extras/6bb3d69522d710862858920f3a3056b3.webm?t=1761153332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107010/extras/6bb3d69522d710862858920f3a3056b3.mp4?t=1761153332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, you'll face <strong>environmental puzzles</strong> that require sharp eyes and clever thinking. Clues are hidden on walls, in <strong>hieroglyphs</strong>, and among the small details of the world. Be ready for challenges \u2013 nothing is handed to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107010/extras/91047956fbba5bc9c87edb1b799ddc8b.poster.avif?t=1761153332\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107010/extras/91047956fbba5bc9c87edb1b799ddc8b.webm?t=1761153332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107010/extras/91047956fbba5bc9c87edb1b799ddc8b.mp4?t=1761153332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This slice of the game offers several dozen minutes of exploration, light platforming, and an introduction to the story. It's a glimpse into a larger tale of magic, <strong>mythology</strong>, and the courage of <strong>a small cat in ancient Egypt</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107010/extras/11b17aed4773e3863cc9682ec1c47608.poster.avif?t=1761153332\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107010/extras/11b17aed4773e3863cc9682ec1c47608.webm?t=1761153332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107010/extras/11b17aed4773e3863cc9682ec1c47608.mp4?t=1761153332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4107010?t=1761153332","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107010/24e5db46fb2cbeb0affd939b0a626d2a45a65346/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761153332","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107010/e696dffd297acc89f6e0505fdf0a2e8daf01cfc5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761153332","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107010/e696dffd297acc89f6e0505fdf0a2e8daf01cfc5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761153332","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Begin your Ta-Miu adventure!\u00a0\ud83d\udc08</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this playable demo, you\u2019ll discover the beginning of <strong>a feline heroine\u2019s story</strong>, chosen by the goddess <strong>Bastet</strong>. Learn how a stray cat found a new home in the <strong>Pharaoh\u2019s palace</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107010/extras/c92be853c73f92e79b06d85b651e50fc.poster.avif?t=1761153332\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107010/extras/c92be853c73f92e79b06d85b651e50fc.webm?t=1761153332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4107010/extras/c92be853c73f92e79b06d85b651e50fc.mp4?t=1761153332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >